          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">StrykeCam 4K&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The new 4K HDMI output delivers an improved visual experience with 240× zoom and 700° picture rotation, all while maintaining the same footprint and physical dimensions as the previous generation. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">StrykeCam 4K surgical in-light camera is designed to optimize workflow by enabling light-to-light mobility within the Oculan surgical lighting system. </span></p>\n",
